    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Command the children of Israel, that they bring unto thee pure oil olive beaten for the light, to cause the lamps to burn continually.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Without the vail of the testimony, in the tabernacle of the congregation, shall Aaron order it from the evening unto the morning before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "continually:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a statute for ever in your generations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall order the lamps upon the pure candlestick before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "continually.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And thou shalt take fine flour, and bake twelve cakes thereof: two tenth deals shall be in one cake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt set them in two rows, six on a row, upon the pure table before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt put pure frankincense upon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "each",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "row, that it may be on the bread for a memorial,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an offering made by fire unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every sabbath he shall set it in order before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "continually,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being taken",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the children of Israel by an everlasting covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall be Aaron's and his sons'; and they shall eat it in the holy place: for it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "most holy unto him of the offerings of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made by fire by a perpetual statute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the son of an Israelitish woman, whose father",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an Egyptian, went out among the children of Israel: and this son of the Israelitish",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "woman",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and a man of Israel strove together in the camp;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Israelitish woman's son blasphemed the name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of the",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.11"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "char",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "nd"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "LORD",
                  "type": "text",
                  "attrs": {
                    "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
                    "verseOrgIds": [
                      "LEV.24.11"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and cursed. And they brought him unto Moses: (and his mother's name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shelomith, the daughter of Dibri, of the tribe of Dan:)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they put him in ward, that the mind of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "might be shewed them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring forth him that hath cursed without the camp; and let all that heard",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lay their hands upon his head, and let all the congregation stone him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt speak unto the children of Israel, saying, Whosoever curseth his God shall bear his sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he that blasphemeth the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", he shall surely be put to death,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the congregation shall certainly stone him: as well the stranger, as he that is born in the land, when he blasphemeth the name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
